      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Trazodone was associated with the occurrence of life-threatening premature ventricular contractions and angina in a 45-year-old white man who had no prior cardiovascular disease. Caution in prescribing trazodone and in the cardiac monitoring of patients receiving trazodone is recommended."},
